# Graphify first

Prefer existing graph at `graphify-out/graph.json`.

Read-only: `graphify query` · `explain` · `path` · `affected`.

After structural code changes: `graphify update .` only. Never full `extract` / `watch` / `cluster-only` / `label` for surgical edits.

Detail: `.cursor/workflows/GRAPHIFY_FIRST.md` and `.cursor/rules/GRAPHIFY.md`.
